        {
          "id": 2040228688,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> when saving a large file still doing idle dissection into a new format (new compression or new file type).\n\nE.g., you have a large pcap file on which idle is being done and you save it in pcapng format, so it really should stop doing dissection until *the newly-saved file* starts being read in?",
